# File naming

- Use **lowercase train-case** (kebab-case) for all project source files and folders you create or rename.
- Examples: `app.tsx`, `user-profile.tsx`, `auth-api.ts`, `home-page/`
- Do not use PascalCase or camelCase filenames (e.g. avoid `App.tsx`, `UserProfile.tsx`).
- Leave third-party / toolchain defaults alone unless renaming is required (`node_modules`, generated configs that break if renamed).
